OpenPBS 23.06.06: retain Python hooks with Python 3.11/3.12.

Backport the header fix from upstream #2594 and only the Python initialization
changes from #2662 (unrelated build warnings, PTL and documentation omitted):
https://github.com/openpbs/openpbs/commit/1d17427c010c8b288511a6d7b42784a3b5aec830
https://github.com/openpbs/openpbs/commit/a84a5315fb860037bd9d0b380396e2010511237c

PyConfig is available since Python 3.8 (Ubuntu 20.04). Linux uses the explicit
isolated configuration; Windows retains its original initialization path.

